(Section 1. Admission and credits) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.1 A master's programme at the Halvorsen Institute of Technology comprises 120 ECTS) Tj T*
(credits and normally takes two years of full-time study.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.2 The master's thesis is worth 30 ECTS credits.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.3 Applicants must hold a bachelor's degree with at least 180 ECTS credits.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.4 Applications for the autumn intake must be submitted by 15 March.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
