(Section 2. Thesis supervision) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.1 Every master's thesis has a main supervisor who holds a doctorate and is employed by) Tj T*
(the institute.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.2 A thesis carried out in a research laboratory must also have a co-supervisor from) Tj T*
(that laboratory.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.3 A student may change supervisor once, with the approval of the dean of the school.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.4 Students meet their main supervisor at least every two weeks.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
