(Section 3. Assessment) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.1 Each thesis is graded by two examiners on a scale from 1 \(lowest\) to 5 \(highest\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.2 If the two grades differ by more than one grade, the dean of the school appoints a) Tj T*
(third examiner.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.3 The minimum passing grade is 2.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.4 The thesis must be submitted no later than 31 May for graduation in June.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.5 A failed thesis may be resubmitted once, within six months of the decision.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
